# Dataset

This project uses public data from the
Building Data Genome Project 2 (BDG2).

The dataset contains building metadata, hourly meter readings,
and weather observations for non-residential buildings.

## Data used in this project

- Building metadata
- Hourly electricity consumption
- Weather data

The complete raw dataset is not included in this repository
because of its size.

Dataset:
Building Data Genome Project 2

Source:
https://github.com/buds-lab/building-data-genome-project-2

